    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Ch\u1ECDn b\xE0i, kh\xF3a l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn, ch\u1EDD ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt.\nVua th\u1EAFng D\xE2n \xB7 D\xE2n th\u1EAFng N\xF4 l\u1EC7 \xB7 N\xF4 l\u1EC7 th\u1EAFng Vua.\nNg\u01B0\u1EDDi thua \u0111\u1EB7t Xu M\xE1u l\xEAn c\xE2n. Xu th\u1EE9 n\u0103m k\u1EBFt th\xFAc tr\u1EADn.\nS\u1ED5 c\xE1i b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i cho bi\u1EBFt nh\u1EEFng g\xEC c\u1EA3 hai b\xEAn c\xF9ng bi\u1EBFt."
